        },
        {
          "text": "“Ŋul luitalaunos, luesegakinos, alomar omanikoria, atupar ediopet kokidiŋ, luenyamete akiriŋ naka ipegei, ka yeniketal, ka emir: ebala EJAKAIT ebe, Enaŋete kere nepepe.",
