              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebala EJAKAIT ebe, Eyaunete kesi ikusiinacan kere anyoun katekerin kere araut ainakinet mama ejai EJAKAIT, kobalasin, kagalin, kagalin nuimukoritai, kanyubun, kakaalai da, epote oroŋataka lokalaunan Yerusalem, kwape eyauniata idwe luka Isirael ainakinetekec togo loka EJAKAIT, kotoma obore yenelai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
